Other policies

Theorem 5.11 (Soundness under any policy). [machine-checked] Let Z be an admissible configuration
(Definition 3.8) with policy pol, fixed before H is sampled. Then, in the random-oracle model (Assumption 4.10
and Assumption 4.11), the argument ΠZ (Construction 4.15) is index-binding knowledge sound (Definition 2.7),
