triples whose instance lies in it. In IdealℓSim the leakage is pp(M ), N and, for each instance (x, y), the instance
and the request leakage ℓ(M, x, y). The argument Π has zero knowledge with request leakage ℓ on W, with
error ζ, if a simulator Sim exists such that, for all M ∈ I, all environments Env that are W-valid at M , all
q, N ∈ N and every q-query V ∗ ,
