Proof of the soundness theorem

Theorem 5.1 rests on the check of its Lean proof by Lean’s kernel; the printed proof is given to explain it. Each lemma
restates a Lean lemma on which that proof rests, with its hypotheses and constants; part 1 of Lemma A.17 is true, but
no Lean statement has its form. A proof marked outline names Lean’s lemmas and does not argue them. For each
machine-checked statement, Appendix F names the Lean declarations that it renders.

