Lemma A.11 (Index-binding knowledge soundness over separate oracles). [machine-checked] Assume the
conditions of Definition A.7 other than (Hashed-key). Then Π◦Z,pv is index-binding knowledge sound for ReqZ , in the
general form of Definition 2.6 and Definition 2.7, over the separate oracles in the place of H. The extractor is Ext◦ ,
and the error is
