Proof of Theorem 5.5 and Corollary B.9. Part 1 follows the cases of Construction B.8. If Adm(Z) = 0 or Chk(Z) = 0,
then VZ rejects at every hash function. If π cannot be unpacked, VZ rejects (at step 4, on the fixed tuple of

