Proofs on zero knowledge

Appendix C.2 proves Theorem 6.3 and Proposition 6.5: Lemma C.8, Lemma C.9, and Lemma C.10 treat one table,
and Lemma C.12 many tables together with runs of the IOPs. Appendix C.3 proves Theorem 6.6 and Corollary 6.7,
