from [CFW26], files that follow or build on further work of the three researchers whom the acknowledgments
name first [CFWpc], or files not counted as written independently of that work or of ArkLib. That page also
points to the published works that the files cite and names, for adapted code, Mathlib [Mathlib], Lean 4’s core
library and the BLAKE2 reference source code package [BLAKE2]. Under two of the four headings that page
lists files in which a comment names a public work: fifteen files name the Lean library VCV-io [VCVio], and one,
lean/IntegerModel/Model.lean, names the file modeling_llama4.py of Hugging Face transformers, version 5.17.0
[transformers].
