H.2

Cost (Table 3)

Each row gathers three runs, each job’s three on three machines. Each machine that served on the public weights at
the default configuration as fitted to them made its own commitment first, nine in all; three of the nine were named
beforehand as the runs behind the figures. Worse figures of these quantities, not on the released programs, stand in
the release’s table of limits (rows RES-13, RES-19, RES-24, RES-32 to RES-34 and RES-46).
