more than any proof of the timed runs, whose largest has 18,804,532 (18.81 MB, rounded up); no cause is shown
(row RES-6).
• Which proof the timed verifying calls took is not recorded.
• For one commitment the provider keeps 2.15 GB (in the timed runs). While serving at 24 requests a batch,
the prover’s own process held at most 257.1 GB of host memory on the public weight files and 265.5 GB on
synthetic weights, and its container at most 269.7 GB on the public weight files and 278.1 to 278.3 GB on
