“Masking on” is a run’s mode: by the runs’ own summaries the committer sampled the secret seed and no test option
was set, so that, by readings of other sources (Section 1.3; Appendix H.1), values are masked. No run here or in
Section 7.4 tested it (Section 7.5). The release’s docs/figures.tsv gives the conditions and further figures.

